flowchart TB
    Available[Update available] --> Delta[Compatible delta patch available?]
    Delta -->|Yes| DownloadDelta[Download delta]
    Delta -->|No| DownloadFull[Download full APK]
    DownloadDelta --> VerifyDelta[Verify hash, signature, base version]
    VerifyDelta --> DeltaValid{Patch valid and applicable?}
    DeltaValid -->|Yes| ApplyDelta[Apply delta in temporary workspace]
    DeltaValid -->|No| DownloadFull
    ApplyDelta --> Result{Application succeeds?}
    Result -->|Yes| Restart[Restart into new version]
    Result -->|No| DownloadFull
    DownloadFull --> VerifyFull[Verify full APK]
    VerifyFull --> Install[Install full APK]
    Install --> Restart

